{"about_the_game":"<p>Embark on a thrilling puzzle expedition in search of hidden treasure, buried amongst ancient temples, to restore the exotic Mayan civilization of El Dorado. </p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>With Professor McGuffog and Topex, an ancient magical statue, as your guides, solve puzzles to find hidden gems in two exciting modes of play. Challenge yourself to either Quest Mode, solving puzzles along your trek through El Dorado, or Arcade Mode, where your ultimate goal is to earn the highest score possible. But work fast and find as many hidden gems as possible before the sun sets over the ancient temple.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Explore the epic venture today! </p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Two challenging modes of play: Arcade and Quest\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Work your way up the \u201cTreasure Hunting\u201d ranking system\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Earn Magic Glue along the way to help repair your mistaken picks\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Exciting bonus rounds with new twists to solving the puzzles\n\t\t\t\t\t</ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/16090?t=1447352197","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/16090?t=1447352197","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/16090/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1447352197","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/16090/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1447352197","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p>Embark on a thrilling puzzle expedition in search of hidden treasure, buried amongst ancient temples, to restore the exotic Mayan civilization of El Dorado. </p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>With Professor McGuffog and Topex, an ancient magical statue, as your guides, solve puzzles to find hidden gems in two exciting modes of play. Challenge yourself to either Quest Mode, solving puzzles along your trek through El Dorado, or Arcade Mode, where your ultimate goal is to earn the highest score possible. But work fast and find as many hidden gems as possible before the sun sets over the ancient temple.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Explore the epic venture today! </p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Two challenging modes of play: Arcade and Quest\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Work your way up the \u201cTreasure Hunting\u201d ranking system\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Earn Magic Glue along the way to help repair your mistaken picks\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Exciting bonus rounds with new twists to solving the puzzles\n\t\t\t\t\t</ul>","developers":["MumboJumbo"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/16090/header.jpg?t=1447352197","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2007 Copyright Lobstersoft. All rights Reserved. Published under license by MumboJumbo, LLC","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Gemsweeper","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 2000/XP/Vista</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><strong>Processor:</strong> Pentium II 300MHz</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><strong>Memory:</strong> 128MB RAM</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 16 or 32 bit color Video Card</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><strong>Hard Drive:</strong> 128MB free HD space</li>\n\t\t\t\t</ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"ratings":null,"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":""},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/16090/ss_74dd0676f235a690415f482aca56b4235d11463d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1447352197","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/16090/ss_74dd0676f235a690415f482aca56b4235d11463d.600x338.jpg?t=1447352197"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/16090/ss_46965ea40d658f4e4e2b7dc77